2. As the Viewer, send `GET /api/trpc/application.one?batch=1&input={"0":{"json":{"applicationId":"APPLICATION_ID"}}}` with the Viewer session cookie. For Compose, use `/api/trpc/compose.one` and `{"composeId":"COMPOSE_ID"}`. Read `refreshToken` from the response.
